<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Continental Air started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Continental Air started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it started coverage of Continental Airlines Inc as market performer with a 12-month price target of $26.</p>
<p>-- In a report, analyst Jeffrey Long said new management has reshaped Continental &quot;from bankrupt and bereft to profitable and aggressive.&quot;  But he added, &quot;Our enthusiasm for Continental's turnaround is tempered by our view of a tougher industry environment in 1997.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 25 Monday.</p>
</text>
